### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{host}}/api/client/seckill/activities/1/skus
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### 33 【必做】活动预热：活动库存写进 Redis
### 不预热的话抢购会返回「活动库存尚未预热」
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
POST {{host}}/api/admin/seckill/activities/1/warmup
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### 34 抢购 20 吨石灰石 5-10mm（Redis Lua 原子扣减）
### 期望：success=true，remainStock=244，返回令牌号
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name grab
POST {{host}}/api/client/seckill/grab
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "seckillSkuId": 2,
  "qty": 20
}

> {%
    client.test("抢购成功", function () {
        client.assert(response.body.data.success === true, "没抢到: " + response.body.data.reason);
    });
    client.global.set("tokenNo", response.body.data.tokenNo);
%}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### 35 【一人一单】重复抢购
### 期望：success=false，reason="每人限抢一份，你已经抢到过了"
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
POST {{host}}/api/client/seckill/grab
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "seckillSkuId": 2,
  "qty": 5
}

> {%
    client.test("一人一单生效", function () {
        client.assert(response.body.data.success === false, "居然抢到了第二单！");
    });
%}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### 36 【超限】一次抢 100 吨（限购 60）
